<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-header"><div><h1>Isi Saldo</h1><p>Tambahkan saldo agar pembayaran produk dapat diproses lebih cepat.</p></div></div><div class="stat-card featured wallet-balance"><span>Saldo tersedia</span><strong><%= formatIDR(wallet.balance) %></strong><small>Saldo dapat dipakai pada checkout yang mendukung Wallet.</small></div><div class="section"><h2>Pilih nominal deposit</h2><div class="amount-grid"><% [10000,25000,50000,100000].forEach(v=>{ %><button class="amount-button" data-deposit-amount="<%= v %>"><%= formatIDR(v) %></button><% }) %><div class="amount-custom-row">
<label class="field amount-custom"><span>Costum Nominal</span><input id="deposit-custom" inputmode="numeric" type="text" placeholder="Rp"></label>
<div class="field amount-last-deposit-field">
  <span>Terakhir Deposit</span>

<% if(lastDeposit){ %>
<button
  class="amount-button amount-last-deposit-button"
  type="button"
  data-deposit-amount="<%= Number(lastDeposit.amount) %>"
  aria-label="Gunakan nominal deposit terakhir <%= formatIDR(lastDeposit.amount) %>"
><%= formatIDR(lastDeposit.amount) %></button>
<% } else { %>
<button
  class="amount-button amount-last-deposit-button"
  type="button"
  disabled
>Belum ada deposit</button>
<% } %>

</div>
</div>
</div><button class="button button-primary button-block" data-deposit-submit><%- icon('wallet') %> Lanjut ke Pembayaran</button><p class="muted small">Setelah nominal dipilih, kamu akan diarahkan ke proses pembayaran yang tersedia.</p></div><div class="section"><div class="section-header"><h2>Riwayat deposit</h2></div><div class="stack-list deposit-history-list"><% deposits.forEach(d=>{ %><div class="list-card history-mutation-card">
  <strong class="history-mutation-type">Deposit</strong>
  <b class="history-mutation-amount"><%= formatIDR(d.amount) %></b>
  <button class="history-mutation-reference history-mutation-reference-copy"
          type="button"
          data-history-reference-copy
          data-copy-value="<%= d.reference || d.id || '' %>"
          aria-label="Salin ID lengkap <%= d.reference || d.id || '' %>"
          title="Ketuk untuk menyalin ID lengkap"
          <%= (d.reference || d.id) ? '' : 'disabled' %>><%= String(d.reference || '').toUpperCase().startsWith('DEPOSIT-') ? String(d.reference).slice(0, 16) : (d.reference || (d.id ? String(d.id).slice(0, 8) : '—')) %></button>
  <span class="history-mutation-status badge badge-<%= String(d.status||'').toLowerCase() %>"><%= labelStatus(d.status) %></span>
  <span class="history-mutation-date"><%= new Intl.DateTimeFormat('id-ID', {day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric',timeZone:'Asia/Jakarta'}).format(new Date(d.created_at)) %>, <%= new Intl.DateTimeFormat('id-ID', {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hourCycle:'h23',timeZone:'Asia/Jakarta'}).format(new Date(d.created_at)) %></span>
  <span class="history-mutation-zone">[ WIB ]</span>
</div><% }) %><% if(!deposits.length){ %><%- include('../partials/empty',{title:'Belum ada deposit',description:'Transaksi deposit akan tampil di sini.'}) %><% } %></div>
<%- include('../partials/pagination',{
  pagination:depositsPagination,
  param:'page'
}) %>
</div></section>
